      "en": "Ibn Kathir: This verse forbids the pre-Islamic practice of inheriting women by force and harming them unjustly. Retention is allowed only when clear immorality is proven, and spouses must live together in kindness. Some Arabs would neglect wives they disliked without divorcing them; the verse warns against hastily divorcing, for Allah may place much good in what one dislikes."
