      "en": "Ibn Kathir: The verse was revealed regarding prayer and approaching it while intoxicated, before wine was finally prohibited. One in janābah may only pass through a mosque until cleansing. When water is missing, tayammum suffices; Allāh is Pardoning and Forgiving in easing the law for His servants."
