      "en": "Ibn Kathir: Some companions had killed men who greeted with peace while claiming they were not believers, seeking booty. Allāh commands thorough investigation and acceptance of Islam's signs when sincere. Worldly spoils are not worth shedding unlawful blood; Allāh is fully Aware of deeds."
