      "en": "Ibn Kathir: To be upright in justice and witnesses for Allāh requires testimony for truth alone, not for relatives or wealth. Rich or poor, Allāh is more concerned with their rights than partial kinship. Distorting or refusing testimony is oppression; believers must speak justly without favoritism."
