      "en": "Ibn Kathir: The verse rebukes those preoccupied with others' state while neglecting themselves. Upon you are your own souls each believer must save himself through righteous deeds. Those astray do not harm the guided who hold to truth; all return to Allāh to be recompensed for their deeds."
