    "guidance": {
      "bm": "Jangan pilih keselesaan dunia berbanding jihad nafs dan kewajipan — renungkan betapa singkatnya kesenangan dunia.",
      "en": "Do not prefer worldly comfort over inner struggle and duty — reflect how brief worldly pleasure is."
    },
    "tafsir": {
      "bm": "Ibn Kathir: Diturunkan berkaitan gembira Nabi ke Tabuk dan lambatnya beberapa sahabat; dikatakan ‘athaqaltum ila al-ard’ — berat hati berangkat. Allah cela mengutamakan hayat dunia daripada akhirat kerana nikmat dunia sangat kecil berbanding syurga. Ini menguatkan semangat berinfak dan berjuang.",
      "en": "Ibn Kathir: Revealed regarding the call to Tabuk when some companions lingered; they ‘adhered heavily to the earth’ by reluctance to march. Allah rebukes preferring worldly life over the Hereafter, for worldly enjoyment is trivial compared to Paradise. It encourages readiness to strive and give."
    }
