      "en": "Ibn Kathir: Believers are commanded to fight disbelievers adjacent to them — nearby Arab tribes not yet subdued — so they find firmness in the Muslims. ‘Allah is with the righteous’ means His aid for the muttaqin. The verse calls for readiness and moral strength within the rules of jihad."
