      "en": "Ibn Kathir: Etiquette for the Prophet’s home: enter when invited, do not wait for food, leave after eating, and avoid lingering talk that troubled him. Requests to his wives are from behind a screen. Marrying his wives after his death is forbidden forever — they are mothers of the believers. Harming the Messenger is a grave sin."
