      "en": "Ibn Kathir: Much negative assumption is forbidden because some suspicion is sinful. Spying and backbiting are likened to eating a dead brother's flesh—repulsive to reason and faith. Taqwa and repentance are emphasized because Allah is Oft-Forgiving, Most Merciful. The verse closes avenues of slander and division in the ummah."
